  "open_work": [
    "Five original source identities, hidden source poses, roles and materials remain. The source explicitly describes an unused soda fountain.",
    "Fabricate the original floor-seated marble case as a plinth, supported end/rear panels and inset front panels. Retain its original 2.2m by 0.8m plan, 0.01m base and 1.03m top. Its separately worked original marble counter retains its complete plan and 1.03m to 1.08m datums.",
    "Three chrome tap feet retain original source centres, 1.08m base and 1.52m maximum control height. Actual hollow gooseneck mouths turn toward the clear central worktop; three separate shallow catch trays sit beneath them without overlapping the original feet.",
    "Static cabinet and fittings establish no flowing water, syrup, refrigeration, drainage, chemical identity, medical operation or dispensing owner. No wall, floor or independent service cutout is authorized by this fixture-only adaptation.",
    "Actual native stock joins, open mouths, tray cavities, floor/contact seats, metre charts and standing observations must be inspected before installation or review retention.",
    "This INERT source plan establishes no runtime proof, route or human acceptance. Stools, other fixtures, independent utilities and engineering capacity retain their own owners."
  ]
